{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Tikway Wan 视频 API",
    "description": "阿里云百炼 Wan 模型的 OpenAI 兼容异步视频生成接口。",
    "version": "1.1.0"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "视频生成"
    },
    {
      "name": "视频生成/Wan"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/videos": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建 Wan 视频",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "通过统一的 `POST /v1/videos` 创建 Wan 视频任务。模型能力以当前 Tikway 网关实际可调用范围为准。\n\n| 模型 | 分辨率 | 时长 | 支持模式 | 音频 | 参考限制 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `wan-3.0` | 480p / 720p / 1080p | 2–30 秒或 -1 智能时长 | 文生、首帧、首尾帧、全模态参考 | 支持，默认开启 | 10 图 / 5 视频 / 5 音频；另可传 1 个文件或链接 |\n| `wan-2.7` | 720p / 1080p | 生成 2–15 秒；参考/编辑 2–10 秒 | 文生、首帧、首尾帧、续写、参考、编辑 | 支持 | 模式相关 |\n| `wan-2.6` | 720p / 1080p | 生成 2–15 秒；参考 2–10 秒 | 文生、首帧、参考；首尾帧/编辑使用兼容模型 | 支持；兼容模式可能无声 | 参考生视频 1–5 个图片/视频 |\n\n来源：[阿里云视频生成模型总览](https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/use-video-generation)。官网能力与当前网关未开放能力之间的差异见本次审计报告。",
        "tags": [
          "视频生成/Wan"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "title": "WanVideoCreateRequest",
                "description": "创建 Wan 视频任务。参数按当前 Tikway 网关能力收窄；模型之间的差异见 operation 描述与 x-model-capabilities。",
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "model"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "model": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "wan-3.0",
                      "wan3.0-video",
                      "wan-2.7",
                      "wan-2.6"
                    ],
                    "description": "Wan 模型 ID。"
                  },
                  "prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "description": "视频生成或编辑提示词。"
                  },
                  "negative_prompt": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Wan 2.6/2.7 可用。Wan 3.0 不支持顶层 negative_prompt；如上游扩展已支持，请放入 extra_body。"
                  },
                  "size": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[1-9][0-9]*[x*][1-9][0-9]*$",
                    "description": "仅 wan-2.6 支持精确像素尺寸；其他 Wan 模型请使用 resolution + aspect_ratio。"
                  },
                  "duration": {
                    "oneOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": -1,
                        "maximum": 30
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "string",
                        "pattern": "^(?:-1|[2-9]|[12][0-9]|30)$"
                      }
                    ],
                    "description": "视频时长（秒）。Wan 3.0 为 2–30 或 -1；Wan 2.7/2.6 的上限随生成模式变化，详见模型能力表。"
                  },
                  "aspect_ratio": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "adaptive",
                      "16:9",
                      "9:16",
                      "1:1",
                      "4:3",
                      "3:4"
                    ],
                    "description": "视频宽高比。图生视频时，部分模型会按输入素材自动决定比例。"
                  },
                  "resolution": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "480p",
                      "720p",
                      "1080p"
                    ],
                    "description": "输出分辨率。不同模型或模式的可用值见模型能力表。"
                  },
                  "frame_images": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "maxItems": 2,
                    "description": "首帧或尾帧参考图；同一类型最多一张。",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "type",
                        "image_url"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "first_frame",
                            "last_frame"
                          ],
                          "description": "参考帧位置。"
                        },
                        "image_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "参考图 URL 字符串。"
                        }
                      },
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  },
                  "input_references": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "maxItems": 21,
                    "description": "Wan 参考素材。不同模型和模式的数量限制不同；Wan 3.0 的参考素材不能与首尾帧混用，file 与 link 互斥。",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "oneOf": [
                        {
                          "required": [
                            "image_url"
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "required": [
                            "video_url"
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "required": [
                            "audio_url"
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "required": [
                            "file_url"
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "required": [
                            "link_url"
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "image_url",
                            "video_url",
                            "audio_url",
                            "file_url",
                            "link_url"
                          ],
                          "description": "可选。素材类型；若提供，必须与对应 URL 字段一致。"
                        },
                        "role": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "reference_image",
                            "reference_video",
                            "reference_audio",
                            "source_video",
                            "first_clip",
                            "driving_audio",
                            "file",
                            "link"
                          ],
                          "description": "素材用途。省略时按 URL 字段推断为普通参考素材。"
                        },
                        "image_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "图片 URL 字符串。"
                        },
                        "video_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "视频 URL 字符串。"
                        },
                        "audio_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "音频 URL 字符串。"
                        },
                        "file_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "文件 URL 字符串。"
                        },
                        "link_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "format": "uri",
                          "description": "网页 URL 字符串。"
                        },
                        "reference_voice": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "description": "预设音色 ID；仅部分支持音色参考的模型使用。"
                        }
                      },
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    }
                  },
                  "generate_audio": {
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "description": "是否生成音频。Wan 3.0 默认开启；Wan 2.6/2.7 的具体行为由模式决定。"
                  },
                  "seed": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": -1,
                    "maximum": 2147483647,
                    "description": "随机种子。固定种子只能提高可复现性，不保证输出完全一致。"
                  },
                  "callback_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "pattern": "^https://",
                    "description": "用户任务回调地址。由 Tikway 在任务状态变化后调用，不直接传给模型上游。"
                  },
                  "extra_body": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "阿里云百炼视频模型扩展参数。字段会合并到上游 parameters。",
                    "properties": {
                      "prompt_extend": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否开启提示词改写。"
                      },
                      "shot_type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "single",
                          "multi"
                        ],
                        "description": "单镜头或多镜头。"
                      },
                      "watermark": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "description": "是否添加水印。"
                      },
                      "audio_setting": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "auto",
                          "origin"
                        ],
                        "description": "视频编辑时的音频处理方式。"
                      }
                    },
                    "additionalProperties": false
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "x-model-capabilities": [
                  {
                    "model": "wan-3.0",
                    "resolution": "480p / 720p / 1080p",
                    "duration": "2–30 秒或 -1 智能时长",
                    "modes": "文生、首帧、首尾帧、全模态参考",
                    "audio": "支持，默认开启",
                    "references": "10 图 / 5 视频 / 5 音频；另可传 1 个文件或链接"
                  },
                  {
                    "model": "wan-2.7",
                    "resolution": "720p / 1080p",
                    "duration": "生成 2–15 秒；参考/编辑 2–10 秒",
                    "modes": "文生、首帧、首尾帧、续写、参考、编辑",
                    "audio": "支持",
                    "references": "模式相关"
                  },
                  {
                    "model": "wan-2.6",
                    "resolution": "720p / 1080p",
                    "duration": "生成 2–15 秒；参考 2–10 秒",
                    "modes": "文生、首帧、参考；首尾帧/编辑使用兼容模型",
                    "audio": "支持；兼容模式可能无声",
                    "references": "参考生视频 1–5 个图片/视频"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "文生视频": {
                  "summary": "文生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "wan-3.0",
                    "prompt": "一只金毛寻回犬在日落时分的海滩上奔跑，镜头平稳跟随，画面具有自然细腻的电影质感。",
                    "duration": 8,
                    "resolution": "1080p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "generate_audio": true
                  }
                },
                "首尾帧生视频": {
                  "summary": "首尾帧生视频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "wan-3.0",
                    "prompt": "从首帧自然过渡到尾帧，保持主体、构图与视觉风格连贯。",
                    "duration": 8,
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "adaptive",
                    "frame_images": [
                      {
                        "type": "first_frame",
                        "image_url": "https://example.com/assets/first-frame.jpg"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "last_frame",
                        "image_url": "https://example.com/assets/last-frame.jpg"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "全模态参考": {
                  "summary": "全模态参考",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "wan-3.0",
                    "prompt": "保持参考素材中的人物身份与视觉风格，生成一段连贯的电影感短片。",
                    "duration": 10,
                    "resolution": "720p",
                    "input_references": [
                      {
                        "image_url": "https://example.com/assets/character.jpg",
                        "role": "reference_image"
                      },
                      {
                        "video_url": "https://example.com/assets/style.mp4",
                        "role": "reference_video"
                      },
                      {
                        "audio_url": "https://example.com/assets/voice.mp3",
                        "role": "reference_audio"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$id": "https://api.example.com/schemas/videos/create-response.json",
                  "title": "创建视频任务响应",
                  "description": "POST /v1/videos 创建视频任务成功后的响应参数，接口返回 HTTP 202。",
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "id",
                    "status",
                    "polling_url"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "description": "视频生成任务的唯一标识，用于后续查询任务状态。",
                      "examples": [
                        "9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239"
                      ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "pending",
                        "queue"
                      ],
                      "description": "任务创建状态。pending 表示任务已创建、等待提交处理；queue 表示任务已进入生成队列。",
                      "examples": [
                        "queue"
                      ]
                    },
                    "polling_url": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uri",
                      "pattern": "^https://",
                      "description": "视频任务查询地址，客户端可通过 GET 请求轮询任务状态。",
                      "examples": [
                        "https://api.example.com/v1/videos/9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "additionalProperties": false
                },
                "example": {
                  "id": "9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239",
                  "status": "pending",
                  "polling_url": "https://api.tikway.ai/v1/videos/9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239"
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/v1/videos/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询 Wan 视频任务",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "",
        "tags": [
          "视频生成/Wan"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "视频生成任务的唯一标识符。",
            "required": true,
            "example": "8f7c2e41-5a93-4b16-9d72-3c84e1a6f205",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-debugger-mode",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "",
            "example": "true",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "true"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询视频任务。完成时返回对象形式的 data；其他状态不返回 data。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$id": "https://api.example.com/schemas/videos/retrieve-response.json",
                  "title": "查询视频任务响应",
                  "description": "GET /v1/videos/{id} 的响应参数。data 为最终结果对象，仅在 status=completed 时返回；其他状态省略 data。",
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "created",
                    "id",
                    "model",
                    "prompt",
                    "status",
                    "usage"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "created": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "description": "视频任务创建时间，Unix 时间戳，单位为秒。",
                      "examples": [
                        1789108566
                      ]
                    },
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "description": "视频生成任务的唯一标识。",
                      "examples": [
                        "9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239"
                      ]
                    },
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1,
                      "description": "创建视频任务时使用的模型 ID。",
                      "examples": [
                        "bytedance/seedance-2.0-mini"
                      ]
                    },
                    "prompt": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "创建视频任务时提交的提示词。",
                      "examples": [
                        "一只金毛犬在日落时分的海滩上奔跑，镜头平稳跟随，画面呈现自然细腻的电影质感"
                      ]
                    },
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "pending",
                        "queue",
                        "in_progress",
                        "completed",
                        "failed",
                        "cancelled",
                        "expired"
                      ],
                      "description": "任务状态。pending 表示等待处理；queue 表示排队中；in_progress 表示生成或平台处理进行中；completed 表示视频和 OSS 资源均已处理完成；failed 表示失败；cancelled 表示已取消；expired 表示已过期。",
                      "examples": [
                        "in_progress"
                      ]
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "native_url",
                        "video_url",
                        "frame"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "native_url": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "required": [
                            "url"
                          ],
                          "properties": {
                            "url": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "format": "uri",
                              "minLength": 1,
                              "description": "供应商原始视频的完整 URL，保留供应商返回的查询参数。"
                            }
                          },
                          "additionalProperties": false,
                          "description": "供应商原始视频地址对象。"
                        },
                        "video_url": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "required": [
                            "url"
                          ],
                          "properties": {
                            "url": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "format": "uri",
                              "minLength": 1,
                              "description": "平台存储的视频访问 URL。"
                            }
                          },
                          "additionalProperties": false,
                          "description": "平台转存后的视频地址对象。"
                        },
                        "frame": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "required": [
                            "first_url",
                            "last_url"
                          ],
                          "properties": {
                            "first_url": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "format": "uri",
                              "minLength": 1,
                              "description": "视频首帧图片的访问 URL。"
                            },
                            "last_url": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "format": "uri",
                              "minLength": 1,
                              "description": "视频尾帧图片的访问 URL。"
                            }
                          },
                          "additionalProperties": false,
                          "description": "视频首尾帧地址对象。"
                        }
                      },
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "description": "最终结果对象，只有 status=completed 时存在。其他状态省略整个 data 字段，不返回数组或 null。"
                    },
                    "usage": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "视频任务的使用量信息。",
                      "required": [
                        "video_seconds"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "video_seconds": {
                          "description": "生成视频的时长，单位为秒。暂时无法确定时可能为 null。",
                          "oneOf": [
                            {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "minimum": 0
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "null"
                            }
                          ],
                          "examples": [
                            4
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "additionalProperties": false
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "任务失败信息。通常仅在 status 为 failed 时返回。",
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "message"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "description": "供应商或平台返回的错误码。",
                          "examples": [
                            "video_generation_failed"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "任务失败的具体原因。",
                          "examples": [
                            "Video generation failed."
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "additionalProperties": true
                    }
                  },
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "if": {
                        "properties": {
                          "status": {
                            "const": "completed"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "status"
                        ]
                      },
                      "then": {
                        "required": [
                          "data"
                        ]
                      },
                      "else": {
                        "not": {
                          "required": [
                            "data"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                },
                "examples": {
                  "进行中": {
                    "summary": "进行中",
                    "value": {
                      "created": 1789108566,
                      "id": "9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239",
                      "model": "wan-3.0",
                      "prompt": "一只金毛犬在日落时分的海滩上奔跑，镜头平稳跟随，海风吹动毛发，画面呈现自然细腻的电影质感",
                      "status": "in_progress",
                      "usage": {
                        "video_seconds": 4
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "已完成": {
                    "summary": "已完成",
                    "value": {
                      "created": 1789108566,
                      "id": "9552de3d-171f-4cca-b492-7baa56523239",
                      "model": "wan-3.0",
                      "prompt": "一只金毛犬在日落时分的海滩上奔跑，镜头平稳跟随，海风吹动毛发，画面呈现自然细腻的电影质感",
                      "status": "completed",
                      "data": {
                        "video_url": {
                          "url": "https://oss.example.com/temp/2026/09/11/video.mp4?expires=86400"
                        },
                        "native_url": {
                          "url": "https://provider.example.com/videos/video.mp4?expires=86400"
                        },
